[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10980.59, "timestamp": "03:03:00", "text": "向上。这里一个人也没有。什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10984.03, "timestamp": "03:03:04", "text": "这？肯定有什么事发生了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10987.67, "timestamp": "03:03:07", "text": "那里。让我们试着摆脱所有这些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10990.269, "timestamp": "03:03:10", "text": "远远超过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10992.75, "timestamp": "03:03:12", "text": "那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10996.349, "timestamp": "03:03:16", "text": "糟糕。这是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10999.23, "timestamp": "03:03:19", "text": "嗯？那是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11001.469, "timestamp": "03:03:21", "text": "怪物？那是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11013.07, "timestamp": "03:03:33", "text": "那？哦。哦。什么是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11017.03, "timestamp": "03:03:37", "text": "这？这是“我的天哪”吗？障碍"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11018.59, "timestamp": "03:03:38", "text": "障碍物"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11022.87, "timestamp": "03:03:42", "text": "方式。请。你在开玩笑吧？我是谁？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11025.71, "timestamp": "03:03:45", "text": "现在说这个是不是太早了？好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11035.03, "timestamp": "03:03:55", "text": "然后。等等，我想我应该是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11037.429, "timestamp": "03:03:57", "text": "这里。哦，不。不，不，不，不，不。等待，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11039.79, "timestamp": "03:03:59", "text": "等待。不"}]